R-YK6 R-EC2 R-CM21 (slice 249, Q629-3 and Q629-1 follow the recommendation): the reason is checked before any request, with the rule of the registry (at most 500 bytes of UTF-8, no control character: a tab is one). Exit 2, not the exit 1 of a 400 answer. The check is after the operand and before the repository (run 3 has no repository and still gets the reason text; run 4 has no tag and still gets the tag text).
